Description: palOS Store: apps, updates and drivers
 Browse, search, install and remove apps from the .deb software
 archive (thousands of apps, with icons, screenshots and descriptions from
 its AppStream catalog) and from the Snap Store. An app offered both
 ways has one card, with a switch between the .deb and the snap. Snap
 support (snapd) is set up the first time someone installs a snap. Apps
 that need 32-bit libraries, like Steam, switch 32-bit support on as they
 install. Updates shows everything waiting to be installed (snaps too) and
 installs it in one go; Drivers offers the hardware drivers the
 archive provides, including the manufacturers' own (proprietary) ones.
 .
 Runs on Seeker's Electron runtime.
